        "thought_text": "Thought-3: Instead of using a simple DFS approach, implement a backtracking algorithm to explore all possible placements of smaller polyominoes. Track visited cells to ensure no cell is reused within the same placement. If a valid placement is found, mark the cells accordingly and proceed to the next part. If no valid placement is found, backtrack and try another configuration. This method ensures that all possible divisions are explored without getting stuck in infinite recursions.",
